{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rRhMeH7Peg1795509227.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。主控官郭莎樂盤問鄺港智，質疑他事後改稱書面口供不可信，是企圖把殺人責任推卸給父親鄺球，鄺港智堅稱當初落口供時，被警方引導、簡略及修改，並非其完整陳述。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.PM 1500 NEW.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wtu7J4jni31795509238.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>郭莎樂又稱，被指是兇器的圓頭錘有鄺港智的DNA，質疑他曾接觸兇器。鄺港智指自己無法解釋，形容自己「掂都無掂過」，亦無見過。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.PM 1500 NEW_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026r82tDTVs5W1795509264.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他又反駁圓頭錘由哥哥鄺港傑購買，但上面卻沒有其指紋及DNA，形容是匪夷所思。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:23:58.115653+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:37:17.561810+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:19.080977+00:00","content_hash":"9b87a915336b6bab2df52c28c9a29a3ffe14ca069f8c186244147aae66ad29d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}